## 5. 核心数据模型

### 5.1 内部状态

内部状态只存在于服务端内存与事件重放结果中，不直接同步给客户端。

```typescript
type GameState = {
  roomId: string;
  phase: Phase;
  players: Record<PlayerId, InternalPlayer>;
  seats: PlayerId[];
  ship: {
    x: number;
    y: number;
    heading: "east" | "west" | "north";
  };
  offices: {
    captainId?: PlayerId;
    firstMateId?: PlayerId;
    navigatorId?: PlayerId;
  };
  hands: {
    destinationDeck: DestinationCard[];
    captainHand: DestinationCard[];
    firstMateHand: DestinationCard[];
    navigatorChoice?: DestinationCard;
    discardPile: DestinationCard[];
  };
  roundNo: number;
  termRemaining: number;
  winner?: Faction;
};

type InternalPlayer = {
  id: PlayerId;
  nickname: string;
  connected: boolean;
  faction: Faction;
  role: Role;
  guns: number;
  muted: boolean;
  dead: boolean;
};
```

### 5.2 客户端视图

客户端只接收当前玩家视角的 `PlayerView`。同一时刻，不同玩家收到的 JSON 可以不同。

```typescript
type PlayerView = {
  roomId: string;
  viewerId: PlayerId;
  phase: Phase;
  me: VisibleSelf;
  players: VisiblePlayer[];
  ship: PublicShipState;
  offices: PublicOffices;
  publicLog: PublicLogEntry[];
  privatePrompt?: PrivatePrompt;
  hand?: VisibleHand;
  winner?: Faction;
};
```

### 5.3 事件日志

所有合法动作最终都转成 `GameEvent`，追加到事件日志，再由 reducer 推导状态。

```typescript
type GameEvent =
  | { type: "player.joined"; playerId: PlayerId; nickname: string; at: number }
  | { type: "game.started"; seed: string; setup: SetupSnapshot; at: number }
  | { type: "captain.nominated"; captainId: PlayerId; at: number }
  | { type: "officers.assigned"; firstMateId: PlayerId; navigatorId: PlayerId; at: number }
  | { type: "vote.committed"; playerId: PlayerId; guns: number; at: number }
  | { type: "vote.resolved"; totalGuns: number; passed: boolean; at: number }
  | { type: "destination.drawn"; cardIds: string[]; holderId: PlayerId; at: number }
  | { type: "destination.chosen"; cardId: string; by: PlayerId; at: number }
  | { type: "ship.moved"; cardId: string; to: { x: number; y: number }; at: number }
  | { type: "game.ended"; winner: Faction; reason: string; at: number };
```

原则：

- `GameEvent` 可以包含完整秘密，但只保存在服务端与数据库。
- `PublicLogEntry` 是从 `GameEvent` 派生的公开摘要。
- 重连时用当前 `GameState` + `projectView(state, viewerId)` 恢复视图。
- 复盘默认只展示公开视角；管理员调试复盘必须本地运行，不对外暴露。

